## Metadata
- Author: [[Austin Kleon]]
- Full Title: Give Yourself What You Needed Then and Give Your Kids What They Need Now
- Category: #articles
- Summary:: Parents should be mindful not to impose their own unfulfilled dreams onto their children. It is important to balance giving children what they need now while also fulfilling one's own needs. Building a world that accommodates both parent and child desires is a continuous process that evolves over time.
